{"event_id": "DIS-EQ-D5B3F2D9E21ED076", "event_rank": 15, "article_rank": 1, "selected_for_fixed_three": true, "article_id": "ART-4C7D550829BA9273", "title": "6.3级强烈地震震动波哥大", "url": "https://menafn.com/1109649503/Powerful-63-Magnitude-Quake-Shakes-Bogota", "source_domain": "menafn.com", "source_name": "menafn", "published_at": "2025-06-08T00:00:00+00:00", "original_language": "en", "content": "波哥大：据法新社现场记者和美国地质调查局消息，星期六早些时候，一场6.3级强烈浅源地震震动了哥伦比亚首都波哥大。\n\n美国地质调查局称，这场浅源地震于当地时间9:08发生在哥伦比亚中部帕拉特布埃诺市附近，位于波哥大以东约170公里（105英里）。\n\n首都各处建筑物摇晃，警报声四起，人们纷纷涌上街头。社交媒体用户发布了灯具和家具摇晃的视频，但法新社未能立即核实这些画面。\n\n数十名身穿睡衣的人聚集在公园及建筑物外，家长们努力安抚受到惊吓的孩子，还有一些人在寻找跑丢的宠物。\n\n“这次地震非常强烈，”波哥大一名正努力走下几段楼梯的老妇人说。\n\n哥伦比亚中部位于地震活动频繁的区域。1999年，该地区在安塞尔马努埃沃附近发生了一场6.2级地震，造成近1,200人死亡。", "content_sha256": "141429793cdbd28109da0e750cef758274f07d76b24937baba32fab0b5af28c4", "content_edited": true, "original_content_hash": "3f4441f0dd35638b16fa4f35c23aa7f0311239efe7817fb65bdec2a39f368016", "original_word_count": 235, "removed_word_count": 69, "removed_word_ratio": 0.2936170212765957, "content_edit_updated_at": "2026-11-14T07:58:40.494Z", "human_decision": "accept", "human_criteria": {"same_event": "yes", "complete_text": "yes", "correct_time_place": "yes", "independent_source": "yes", "useful_information": "yes"}, "human_note": "", "human_annotation_updated_at": "2026-11-14T07:59:03.419Z", "review_candidate_origin": "formal_include", "auto_link_decision": "include", "auto_link_confidence": 0.83, "auto_link_exclusion_reasons": [], "annotation_dataset_id": "741b8b5b", "annotation_source_file": "human_annotations_741b8b5b.json", "language": "zh"}
